WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:10.900
Narrator: At the stadium, the venue control room confirms the alert within seconds and sends the shelter instruction straight away, working with Civil Defense and the Ministry of Interior.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:18.900
Narrator: You'll hear it on your radio; fans will hear it on the public address and see it on the big screens.

00:00:20.542 --> 00:00:25.342
Narrator: Remember - fans get the phone alert at the same time as you.

00:00:25.542 --> 00:00:28.842
Narrator: Expect questions. Stay calm, and wait for the instruction.

00:00:29.042 --> 00:00:31.042
Narrator: Keep the radio clear.

00:00:31.242 --> 00:00:37.142
Narrator: If no instruction comes after about 15 seconds, tell your supervisor: 'Public alert received, Block C.'
